  "body": "### AreHooksInstalled uses Claude-specific variable, not Codex's

**Medium Severity**

<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->
`AreHooksInstalled` checks for `"go run ${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/cmd/entire/main.go hooks codex stop"`, but `InstallHooks` installs localDev hooks with the prefix `go run "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)"/cmd/entire/main.go hooks codex ...`. The `${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}` variable is Claude Code-specific and will never appear in a Codex `hooks.json`. This means localDev hooks are never detected, causing `DetectPresence` to incorrectly return `false`.
<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->

